      "seq_no": 1,
      "soft_kind": "2",
      "soft_name": "R open-source software",
      "soft_memo": "<table>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<div>R is an integrated suite of software facilities for data manipulation, calculation and graphical display. Among other things it has<br />\n\t\t\t&bull; an effective data handling and storage facility,<br />\n\t\t\t&bull; a suite of operators for calculations on arrays, in particular matrices,<br />\n\t\t\t&bull; a large, coherent, integrated collection of intermediate tools for data analysis,<br />\n\t\t\t&bull; graphical facilities for data analysis and display either directly at the computer or on hard-copy, and<br />\n\t\t\t&bull; a well developed, simple and effective programming language which includes conditionals, loops, user defined recursive functions and input and output facilities.</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n",
      "soft_name_en": "R open-source software",
      "soft_memo_en": "<div>R is an integrated suite of software facilities for data manipulation, calculation and graphical display. Among other things it has<br />\n&bull; an effective data handling and storage facility,<br />\n&bull; a suite of operators for calculations on arrays, in particular matrices,<br />\n&bull; a large, coherent, integrated collection of intermediate tools for data analysis,<br />\n&bull; graphical facilities for data analysis and display either directly at the computer or on hard-copy, and<br />\n&bull; a well developed, simple and effective programming language which includes conditionals, loops, user defined recursive functions and input and output facilities.</div>\n"
    }
  ],
